   "source": [
    "# Visualization Options Summary
",
    "
",
    "This notebook generates multiple visualization variants for reliability diagrams. Here's what each option does:
",
    "
",
    "## Option 1: Bars with/without Histogram (Recommended)
",
    "- **Bars**: Traditional bar chart showing accuracy vs confidence
",
    "- **With histogram**: Adds a histogram below each panel showing sample distribution across confidence bins
",
    "- **Why it's useful**: Histograms show where predictions fall, explaining why some bins are sparse
",
    "
",
    "## Option 2: Curves with/without Histogram
",
    "- **Curves**: Line plot connecting bin centers with error bands
",
    "- **With histogram**: Same histogram option as Option 1
",
    "- **Why it's useful**: Lines show the relationship more clearly when bins have very different sample counts
",
    "
",
    "## Option 3: Adaptive (Equal-Frequency) Binning
",
    "- **What it does**: Distributes samples evenly across bins (equal number of samples per bin)
",
    "- **Available as**: Bars or curves, with or without histogram
",
    "- **Why it's useful**: Makes all methods visually comparable by ensuring all bins are populated
",
    "
",
    "## Option 4: Weighted Alpha Bars
",
    "- **What it does**: Bar transparency is weighted by sample count (more samples = more opaque)
",
    "- **Available with/without histogram**
",
    "- **Why it's useful**: Automatically de-emphasizes sparse bins while keeping them visible
",
    "
",
    "## File Naming Convention
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison` - Original bars, no histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_with_hist` - Bars with histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_curves` - Curves, no histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_curves_with_hist` - Curves with histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_weighted_alpha` - Weighted alpha bars, no histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_weighted_alpha_with_hist` - Weighted alpha bars with histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_adaptive` - Adaptive binning, bars, no histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_adaptive_with_hist` - Adaptive binning, bars with histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_adaptive_curves` - Adaptive binning, curves, no histogram
",
    "- `{model}_{dataset}_comparison_adaptive_curves_with_hist` - Adaptive binning, curves with histogram
"
   ]
